«Двести ступеней» — a trailer in the Woodcut Print style (Lemo-Opuscar library). An original story.

IMAGES: none — every plate (the lighthouse, the sea, the boat, the window, the stairwell, the lamp room, the pier, the title) is
carved in code (film.js) and printed by the WebGL compositor. No photographs, no AI-generated images.
FONTS (SIL OFL 1.1): Old Standard TT (Regular, Bold) — Alexey Kryukov — github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/oldstandardtt (fonts/OldStandard-OFL.txt).
VOICE: Russian narration — Gemini text-to-speech (gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts, voice "Charon") through the Gemini API
  (Google AI Studio), with the film owner's API key; tools/tts_gemini_one.py. Checked with faster-whisper (MIT; Whisper "small", MIT).
  Synthetic voice. Check Google's Gemini API terms for how generated audio may be used.
MUSIC SAMPLES through the library's core/audio/sampler.py: strings, horn, timpani, gran cassa, crash, tubular bells (VS Chamber
  Orchestra: Community Edition, CC0 1.0); log drum, gong, harp, glockenspiel, hand chimes (Versilian Community Sample Library,
  CC0 1.0); see the library's core/audio/INSTRUMENTS.md.
SOUND EFFECTS: rain, wind, sea, thunder, oars, iron steps, the struck metal, the match, the fire, brayer, peel, gulls — synthesised in mix.py.
CODE: engine/*.js and trans.js are from the Lemo-Opuscar library's styles/woodcut/demo (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Lemomo (LemoLab);
  text in LICENSE-MIT.txt).
